{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PSGxe23b2LaThGdm6Qa3j7","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Session and authorization rules\n2\t\n3\t- Reject login and refresh for inactive, locked or deleted accounts.\n4\t- Bind refresh sessions to revocable server-side state and rotate/revoke according to the effective contract.\n5\t- Keep browser access tokens in memory and refresh tokens in correctly scoped HttpOnly cookies.\n6\t- Validate issuer, audience, expiry, signature, token type and token/account version.\n7\t- Authorize on backend permissions; frontend checks are presentation only.\n8\t- Distinguish public and admin portal access through explicit permission checks.\n9\t- Propagate authenticated actor/request context without trusting client-supplied actor metadata.\n10\t- Revoke or invalidate active sessions when security-sensitive account state changes.\n11\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b51249f-7f66-465b-9a4b-fbf4b9aec88f","uuid":"fd3f8b57-0ae3-4c2f-a1a6-1a2b10563b35","timestamp":"2026-08-07T15:14:20.315Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/cmc/Documents/Memories/ai/skills/implement-auth-security-change/references/sessions-and-authorization.md","content":"# Session and authorization rules\n\n- Reject login and refresh for inactive, locked or deleted accounts.\n- Bind refresh sessions to revocable server-side state and rotate/revoke according to the effective contract.\n- Keep browser access tokens in memory and refresh tokens in correctly scoped HttpOnly cookies.\n- Validate issuer, audience, expiry, signature, token type and token/account version.\n- Authorize on backend permissions; frontend checks are presentation only.\n- Distinguish public and admin portal access through explicit permission checks.\n- Propagate authenticated actor/request context without trusting client-supplied actor metadata.\n- Revoke or invalidate active sessions when security-sensitive account state changes.\n","numLines":11,"startLine":1,"totalLines":11}}}
