{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DX1bezmuwsDuHhgg2vjnXc","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Testing checks\n2\t\n3\t- Domain tests cover invariants and state transitions.\n4\t- Use-case tests cover happy path, authorization, failures and transaction behavior.\n5\t- Repository integration tests cover mapping, constraints and queries against PostgreSQL.\n6\t- Module tests resolve providers through Nest's container.\n7\t- E2E tests cover reachable HTTP behavior, guards, DTO validation and response safety.\n8\t- Regression tests fail before the fix and exercise the real boundary involved.\n9\t\n10\tUse configured project commands. Do not substitute mocks for required infrastructure validation.\n11\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b51249f-7f66-465b-9a4b-fbf4b9aec88f","uuid":"e848a3d2-addd-4f74-85bb-94c0f10431e3","timestamp":"2026-08-07T15:14:22.561Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/cmc/Documents/Memories/ai/skills/implement-nestjs-vertical-slice/references/testing.md","content":"# Testing checks\n\n- Domain tests cover invariants and state transitions.\n- Use-case tests cover happy path, authorization, failures and transaction behavior.\n- Repository integration tests cover mapping, constraints and queries against PostgreSQL.\n- Module tests resolve providers through Nest's container.\n- E2E tests cover reachable HTTP behavior, guards, DTO validation and response safety.\n- Regression tests fail before the fix and exercise the real boundary involved.\n\nUse configured project commands. Do not substitute mocks for required infrastructure validation.\n","numLines":11,"startLine":1,"totalLines":11}}}
