eness/indexes and rollback behavior |\n| Presentation | Controller/DTO/validation/auth guard and stable response contract |\n| Verification | Unit tests, adapter integration tests and relevant E2E tests |\n\nCheck imports against module boundaries. Other modules must consume public APIs or application contracts, never internal ORM entities or source paths.\n","numLines":16,"startLine":1,"totalLines":16}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SBjgFbVRdRMSnH7aUvez8f","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Dependency-injection checks\n2\t\n3\tFor every `@Inject(TOKEN)` or constructor dependency:\n4\t\n5\t1. Locate the token declaration and interface.\n6\t2. Locate the concrete adapter or service.\n7\t3. Locate a provider using `provide`, `useClass`, `useFactory`, `useExisting` or a directly injectable class.\n8\t4. Verify its module imports dependencies required by the provider.\n9\t5. Verify the consuming use case/controller is registered.\n10\t6. Verify exports when another module consumes the token.\n11\t7. Compile a testing module or boot the relevant application in an integration/E2E test.\n12\t\n13\tA TypeScript compile does not prove the Nest runtime graph is resolvable.\n14\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b51249f-7f66-465b-9a4b-fbf4b9aec88f","uuid":"420dc879-5ab9-423f-a2bb-41b5ca3bb012","timestamp":"2026-08-07T15:14:23.056Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/cmc/Documents/Memories/ai/skills/implement-nestjs-vertical-slice/references/dependency-injection.md","content":"# Dependency-injection checks\n\nFor every `@Inject(TOKEN)` or constructor dependency:\n\n1. Locate the token declaration and interface.\n2. Locate the concrete adapter or service.\n3. Locate a provider using `provide`, `useClass`, `useFactory`, `useExisting` or a directly injectable class.\n4. Verify its module imports dependencies required by the provider.\n5. Verify the consuming use case/controller is registered.\n6. Verify exports when another module consumes the token.\n7. Compile a testing module or boot the relevant application in an integration/E2E test.\n\nA TypeScript compile does not prove the Nest runtime graph is resolvable.\n","numLines":14,"startLine":1,"totalLines":14}}}
